{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24","rules":[{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:suitability:7a650230","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"environment":["external","internal"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Suitable for interior or exterior applications as an impregating sealer.","heading":"USES","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":1,"page_end":1,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"USES","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:restriction:16ade37a","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not use sprayers which have previously been used for spraying silicones or release agents (oils).","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:suitability:30581272","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["asphalt","waterproofing_membrane"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not use on substrates treated previously with curing agents, membrane forming sealers or asphalt until these layers have been removed completely.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:restriction:058ebb8d","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"Sikafloor® CureHard-24 will not compensate for poor substrates with low cement content","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:restriction:b18abb72","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"It is not intended for substrates which are lightweight or extremely porous or have worn (aggregate exposed) surfaces.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:restriction:fe5e62e4","type":"restriction","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":[],"text":"Sikafloor® CureHard-24 will not hide serious staining or excessive wear.","heading":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"IMPORTANT CONSIDERATIONS","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:suitability:e5fb413c","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["concrete"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Note that Sikafloor® CureHard-24 used a a general sealer will not penetrate burnished or fully polished concrete and is not suitable for this appliction","heading":"SUBSTRATE QUALITY","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"SUBSTRATE QUALITY","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:suitability:dc895760","type":"suitability","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["concrete"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Hardened / old concrete The substrate must be prepared by suitable cleaning method such as high pressure water cleaning or by ride-on cleaning machines","heading":"SUBSTRATE PREPARATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"SUBSTRATE PREPARATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:suitability:4abccd48","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"environment":["floor"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not use Sikafloor® CureHard-24 as a final sealer on polished, finished floors as a sealer - it will not penetrate and will result in an unsatisfactory outcome that will have to be stripped off","heading":"APPLICATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"APPLICATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}},{"id":"sikafloor-curehard-24:suitability:6ef97054","type":"suitability","polarity":"no","conditional":false,"tags":{"substrate":["concrete"]},"mentions":[],"text":"Do not apply as a general sealer on fully burnished/closed/dense concrete surfaces as it will be unable to pentrate.","heading":"APPLICATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sikafloor_curehard-24.pdf","page":4,"page_end":4,"doc_version":"April 2023, Version 02.01","section":"APPLICATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/flooring/resin-flooring/floor-sealers-finishings/sikafloor-curehard-24.html"}}]}